## Pages

1. **Home** (`/home`) - Featured wines and welcome page
2. **Wine List** (`/wines`) - Browse all wines with search and filter
3. **Wine Details** (`/wines/{id}`) - View wine details and reviews
4. **Shopping Cart** (`/cart`) - View and manage cart items
5. **Login** (`/login`) - User authentication
6. **Register** (`/register`) - New user registration
7. **Admin Dashboard** (`/admin`) - Admin panel with statistics

## REST API Endpoints

### Wines
- `GET /api/wines` - Get all wines
- `GET /api/wines/{id}` - Get wine by ID
- `GET /api/wines/search` - Search wines (query params: name, type, year, minPrice, maxPrice)
- `POST /api/wines` - Create wine (Admin only)
- `PUT /api/wines/{id}` - Update wine (Admin only)
- `DELETE /api/wines/{id}` - Delete wine (Admin only)

### Users
- `GET /api/users` - Get all users (Admin only)
- `GET /api/users/{id}` - Get user by ID (Admin only)
- `POST /api/users` - Create user (Admin only)
- `PUT /api/users/{id}` - Update user (Admin only)
- `DELETE /api/users/{id}` - Delete user (Admin only)

### Orders
- `GET /api/orders` - Get all orders (Admin only)
- `GET /api/orders/{id}` - Get order by ID
- `GET /api/orders/user/{userId}` - Get orders by user ID
- `POST /api/orders` - Create order (authenticated users)

### Reviews
- `GET /api/reviews` - Get all reviews
- `GET /api/reviews/{id}` - Get review by ID
- `GET /api/reviews/wine/{wineId}` - Get reviews by wine ID
- `POST /api/reviews/wine/{wineId}/user/{userId}` - Create review

## Security

- **Public Access**: Home, Wine List, Wine Details, Login, Register
- **Authenticated Users**: Cart, Orders, Create Reviews
- **Admin Only**: Admin Dashboard, User Management, Wine Management (CRUD)

## SQL Scripts

SQL scripts are available in `src/main/resources/sql/`:

- `schema.sql` - Database schema creation
- `sample-data.sql` - Sample data insertion

You can run these scripts manually in SQL Server Management Studio if needed, though the application will create tables automatically using JPA.

## Development Notes

- The application uses JPA with `spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update`, so tables are created automatically
- Passwords are encrypted using BCrypt
- Session-based cart management
- CSRF is disabled for simplicity (enable in production)

